      "extracellular": true,
      "functional_impact_measured": "Surface detection of all Nrxn1 isoforms confirmed by the HA tag; the paper states the tag enables detection at the cell surface. No ligand-binding or synaptic-function assay is described in the cited clip.",
      "gene_symbol": "NRXN1",
      "insert_after_residue": 371,
